# 6. Multi-Tenant Architecture

Every business operates within its own secure workspace.

Core entities include:

Business

↓

Users

↓

Customers

↓

Products

↓

Sales

↓

Payments

↓

Expenses

↓

Reports

Every record belongs to a Business.

Every database query is scoped to the current Business through Row Level Security.

Users cannot access data belonging to another Business.

