# 9. Database Architecture

The database is the single source of truth for all confirmed business data.

All entities use:

- UUID primary keys
- UTC timestamps
- Soft deletes where applicable
- Row Level Security
- Audit tracking
- Business ownership

Core tables include:

- businesses
- business_members
- profiles
- customers
- products
- sales
- sale_items
- payments
- expenses
- timeline_events
- audit_logs
- notifications
- ai_memory
- sync_queue
- media_files
- settings

Every business record references:

business_id

This ensures complete tenant isolation.

